{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"title":2,"inWords":3,"equation":4,"parameters":5,"outputs":9,"results":11,"assumptions":14,"buildsOn":17,"sameDomain":21,"citation":40,"learnMore":41},"eclipse-seasons","Stagioni di eclissi","L'orbita della Luna è inclinata di 5°, quindi la sua ombra di solito manca il bersaglio. Solo quando la Luna è entro |β| \u003C 1,5° dall'eclittica al novilunio o al plenilunio può accadere un'eclissi — le stagioni di eclissi due volte all'anno.","\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>β\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>&lt;\u003C/mo>\u003Cmn>1.5\u003C/mn>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">°\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>⇒\u003C/mo>\u003Cmtext>eclipse possible\u003C/mtext>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\beta| &lt; 1.5° \\Rightarrow \\text{eclipse possible}\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">∣\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">∣\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">&lt;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">1.5°\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">⇒\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003